test: unknown no-break control, Unicode offsets, repeated headings, final line
Unknown input stays literal in extracted text and generates a warning.
-- options.json --
{"unterminated":true}
-- input.1 --
.SH "ÜBERSICHT 雪"
雪 and café \fBbold\fR.
'CUSTOM "Ω value" untouched
.SH "ÜBERSICHT 雪"
second
